			"date": "2024-11-21T16:20:57.863Z",
			"content": "<p>nah, follows are records in the user's repository, and you can't edit their repository. i think there was an issue somewhere about this though, not sure if it will ever happen or if it should happen though. and people could block unfollow requests from other people on their own PDSs in the future so</p>",
