				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3zxgigfubnv4f47ftmqdsbal/bafkreifj4yo5qqcz5iluyigjy5gi5d7afrdh2xiendq2fhjxgxd3sccfvi"
			},
			"date": "2024-11-21T16:26:18.507Z",
			"content": "<p>You can block accounts and they will vanish from the follower list you see, but since AT Protocol is open, they can still follow you and see your posts (but not when they are logged in with <a href=\"https://bsky.app\">bsky.app</a>, they need to use a different front end/tool for this).</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
