			},
			"date": "2024-11-21T16:32:28.011Z",
			"content": "<p>Makes sense. As someone not usually targeted I am pretty sure my experience is not very valuable here, but I tend to just mute folks in that category for a bit, which is the opposite (remove a follower from my content).</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
